    "home.story.title": "OUR STORY",
    "home.story.intro": ".....",
    "home.story.d1.date": "September 15, 2024",
    "home.story.d1.sansta": "The day we met!! We met at my Kingdom Hall when Jose Ale came to visit some friends from Venezuela one random day. I had gotten to the meeting a little late and had gone to the bathroom to fix my hair a little, since I'd decided to put a ribbon in my hair that was in braids. My mom had come to the restroom as well and told me that there was someone new visiting 😳, I asked her if I looked okay and ended up deciding to let my hair down. I walked to my seat and sat with the rest of my family. At the end of the meeting I was talking to my friends and decided to greet the new visitors and introduce myself, since I always like to greet anyone that is new and make them feel welcome. I said \"hi my name is Sansta\", and put out my hand for a handshake, he said his name was Alejandro.",
    "home.story.d1.jose": "A sister from the Morton Ranch congregation who is friends with my mom invited us to the meeting and to her home. At the meeting, I remember seeing a sister with a white blouse, a floral skirt, and really beautiful blonde hair sit down in front of me 😳 she commented several times with a Spanish accent. At the end of the meeting she came over to greet me and we talked for the first time. Turns out she wasn't from Spain! 😂 Her name was Sansta, and I liked her.",
    "home.story.d2.date": "October 16, 2024",
    "home.story.d2.sansta": "Jose Ale surprised me with a beautiful flower bouquet delivered to my door to brighten up my day after I had just lost my pet Cookie :( the day before. I was smiling ear to ear, couldn't believe I had gotten flowers delivered to my door from someone I barely even knew that well, it really did brighten up my day, and it made me feel like there was something different about him.",
    "home.story.d2.jose": "The day before, Sansta told me her dog had passed away :( and that she was really sad, so I wanted to cheer her up by sending flowers to her house.",
    "home.story.d3.date": "October 24, 2024",
    "home.story.d3.sansta": "Our first ever date ♡! Jose Ale invited me out to the museum. We went to the Houston Museum of Natural Science and the Houston Museum of Fine Arts. This was the first time we got to talk in person and interact with each other. The conversation was so nice and fun!! After this day, we never stopped seeing each other. We kept going on dates, and Jose Ale started coming to my house at least once a week every week from then on.",
    "home.story.d3.jose": "We were talking and I thought about asking her out, so I asked her what places there were to visit in Houston since I was new and wanted to explore. Knowing she liked art, I suggested we go to the museum with her sister. I was super nervous, so nervous that when I got to the museum parking lot, I tried to turn off the car without putting it in Park first 🥲. We talked a lot and I got to know her better, she seemed very sweet and lovely. At the end of the day we went to eat at Texas Roadhouse.",
    "home.story.d4.date": "January 19, 2025",
    "home.story.d4.sansta": "Jose Ale asked me to be his girlfriend!!! He invited me and my family to their house and they made homemade pizzas for dinner for us. He took me out to the balcony of the apartment where he asked me to be his girlfriend, and I said yes lol. I will never forget that day. It was so special and new, and also the day of my first kiss!! AAA.",
    "home.story.d4.jose": "That week I was very anxious. We had invited Sansta's whole family over to eat at my house, the plan was that I would ask her to be my girlfriend that day. I bought her a gift and my parents made pizzas for everyone. It was such a special and beautiful day. 😍😍 First kiss 🥰",
    "home.story.d5.date": "October 25, 2025",
    "home.story.d5.sansta": "The month before, my uncle had told my mom that he was planning a surprise 10 year anniversary party for my aunt, and that he rented an Airbnb in Galveston for that day, and that he wanted us all to wear white, and that he needed me and Steph's help to decorate the place the day of (so that my aunt wouldn't suspect anything). The day of, me and Steph got dressed and I was in a rush because I had run to the store to put together a surprise gift for my aunt and uncle as well as their card. Steph helped me put together the gift basket and I was calling Jose Ale for him to do me the favor of printing out a couples \"How well do you know each other\" card game set because I wanted my Aunt and Uncle to have something sweet to do together. Steph and I got in the car and I started driving to Galveston. I was a little stressed because we were a tiny bit late, so I asked Steph to let my uncle know. My uncle let us know that he let the doordash person know to leave the decorations at the door. Steph and I finally got to the Airbnb, it was a really cute teal colored beach house. I got out of the car and started walking to the stairs that lead up to the front door, but then saw that there were little hand made signs that led up to the stairs, so I started recording to send in the groupchat with Jose Ale's family, because I was thinking \"Omg my uncle is so cute, I can't believe he cut out these little signs for my aunt, this handwriting totally looks like something Jose Ale would do\" (but I still didn't suspect a thing 💀 LOLLL). The first sign said: \"Mi amor bienvenida\" (My love, welcome) then the next sign said: \"La verdad es que\" (The truth is...), the third sign said: \"Tu Tio no cumple aniversario hoy\" (Your uncle doesn't have his anniversary today). 😳 In that moment I still didn't suspect a thing, I thought \"Omg so my uncle also told my aunt that this was a party for her uncle!!\" LOLLL then I kept walking and the next sign said \"Asi que la sorpresa es: ....\" (So, the surprise is...), then I got to the front door which had a final yellow sign cut out in the shape of a sun that said: \"Para Ti :), Tu eres mi sol\" (For you :), you are my sun). In that moment, I was still recording, and I got a little confused and then pushed the door open, and I felt my heart froze. I couldn't believe my eyes, I was in complete shock. The house was dimly lit by only candles on the floor, with hundreds of flower petals on the floor, creating a pathway to Jose Ale, who was standing at the end of the path that led to a bunch of flower petals in the shape of a heart, with a flower bouquet in hand, and letters behind him that said \"Quieres casarte conmigo?\" (Will you marry me?). Steph took the phone from me and I started walking inside, all I could say was \"Wait, no, stop, I can't believe this, omg\" LOLL. I kept walking, and I was in complete disbelief, I couldn't believe this was happening right now, as this came as a complete surprise to me up until the second I opened the door. Jose Ale got down on one knee, he opened the ring box to show me the ring, and asked me if I wanted to marry him. I said yes, and that day was so special, a day I will never forget. It was perfect, I was so happy, I said yes to the love of my life!! The man of my dreams. I received the biggest surprise of my life!!",
    "home.story.d5.jose": "It took me almost 3 months to plan this day. On August 25th I went to her house to speak with her parents. With the help of both families, we planned the proposal. I bought a sign that said \"Will you marry me?\", got artificial petals, and printed many photos of us. I rented an Airbnb in Galveston for the weekend with both families and Sansta's grandparents. Sandra (Sansta's mom) told her it was supposedly a surprise anniversary party for her uncle. I was incredibly nervous all day, I even struggled to button my shirt because she was already on her way. When she walked through the door and saw everything, I felt so happy. I was trembling, got down on one knee, and asked if she would marry me. And she said YES. I felt like the luckiest man in the world.",
